# scripts/ingest_pvdaq.py.
data/pvdaq_cache/
# Assembled multi-year analytics windows (spec 22). Months concatenated across
# the registry window, QC-error periods already dropped — tens of MB per system
# and rebuildable from the lake. Disposable; regenerate with
# scripts/run_analytics.py. The committed artifact is reports/plant_analytics.json.
data/analytics_cache/
